Package: scexplorer
Title: Interactive Explorer for Seurat Objects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Klaudia", "Zieba", email = "ziebaklaudia4@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny application for interactively exploring any Seurat object:
    UMAP embeddings coloured by metadata, per-gene expression plots, and
    (when present) cluster-marker and contrast tables stored in the object's
    misc slot. Works with plain Seurat objects and with objects produced by
    the scdrake pipeline.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
